    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional  A2-rated  3-bedroom semi-detached residence located at Beechpark, Claremorris, Co. Mayo. \r\n\r\nThis property is  designed for modern life, where comfort, convenience and  community come together. It  has been created with efficiency and everyday living in mind. With its A-rated energy performance this ensures a warm, sustainable, and cost-efficient lifestyle year-round. \r\n\r\nQuality finishes and smart layouts create an inviting environment for families, and anyone seeking a superior living experience.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned within walking distance of Claremorris Town Centre, adjacent to primary & secondary schools with a preschool/creche also within the development, everything you need is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a place to live - it is a place to start your next chapter, in a community designed for today and built for the future.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb family home located in a highly sought after location and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional  A2-rated  3-bedroom semi-detached residence located at Beechpark, Claremorris, Co. Mayo. This property is  designed for modern life, where comfort, convenience and  community come together. It  has been created with efficiency and everyday living in mind. With its A-rated energy performance this ensures a warm, sustainable, and cost-efficient lifestyle year-round. Quality finishes and smart layouts create an inviting environment for families, and anyone seeking a superior living experience.  Perfectly positioned within walking distance of Claremorris Town Centre, adjacent to primary & secondary schools with a preschool/creche also within the development, everything you need is right at your doorstep.  This is more than just a place to live - it is a place to start your next chapter, in a community designed for today and built for the future.  This is a superb family home located in a highly sought after location and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERIOR STANDARD FEATURES\r\n\r\n•\tInsulated concrete floors on ground floor.\r\n•\tHollowcore concrete floors to first floor construction.\r\n•\tCoving to hallway and living room.\r\n•\tStandard white sanitary ware to bathroom, ensuite and downstairs WC.\r\n•\tPower Shower in ensuite.\r\n•\tKitchen and bathroom finished in ceramic wall tiles.\r\n•\tTiling to kitchen and dining room floor, downstairs WC and ensuite. \r\n        (PC Sum including Fitting €1500.00).\r\n•\tQuality fitted kitchen, including integrated fridge, dishwasher, hob and\r\n        oven, extractor fan with vent to external wall included.\r\n•\tAir to Water heating.\r\n•\tInternal painting with a choice of 3 standard colours.\r\n•\tLaminate flooring to upstairs bedrooms.\r\n•\tFloor finishes to sitting room and ground floor hall excluded.\r\n•\tSmoke alarm fitted downstairs and upstairs from mains supply.\r\n•\tGenerous electrical/telephone allowance – see separate list.\r\n•\tConcrete staircase.\r\n•\tHigh quality internal ironmongery.\r\n•\tBlack/White internal doors.\r\n•\tJoinery finished in white gloss paint.\r\n•\tShelved hot press with factory insulated cylinder.\r\n•\tThermostatically controlled rooms.\r\n•\tUnderfloor heating throughout.\r\n\r\n\r\nEXTERIOR STANDARD FEATURES\r\n\r\n•\t10- year structural guarantee\r\n•\tAluminium fascia and soffit.\r\n•\tNap plaster finish to exterior.\r\n•\tPlastered concrete walls to front, back and sides of house.\r\n•\tGrey woodgrain effect PVC triple glazed windows.\r\n•\tComposite front door.\r\n•\tPatio/Barbecue are to rear where applicable.\r\n•\tLawns levelled and seeded.\r\n•\tHigh specification insulation throughout.\r\n•\tWater, sewerage and electrical connection fees.\r\n•\tRadon Gas protection.\r\n•\tConcrete footpaths.\r\n•\tBlue/Black roof slates.\r\n•\tOutside tap.\r\n•\tBrick paving finish to driveways with 2 car spaces.\r\n•\tExternal walls of house painted."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERIOR STANDARD FEATURES  •\tInsulated concrete floors on ground floor. •\tHollowcore concrete floors to first floor construction. •\tCoving to hallway and living room. •\tStandard white sanitary ware to bathroom, ensuite and downstairs WC. •\tPower Shower in ensuite. •\tKitchen and bathroom finished in ceramic wall tiles. •\tTiling to kitchen and dining room floor, downstairs WC and ensuite.          (PC Sum including Fitting €1500.00). •\tQuality fitted kitchen, including integrated fridge, dishwasher, hob and         oven, extractor fan with vent to external wall included. •\tAir to Water heating. •\tInternal painting with a choice of 3 standard colours. •\tLaminate flooring to upstairs bedrooms. •\tFloor finishes to sitting room and ground floor hall excluded. •\tSmoke alarm fitted downstairs and upstairs from mains supply. •\tGenerous electrical/telephone allowance – see separate list. •\tConcrete staircase. •\tHigh quality internal ironmongery. •\tBlack/White internal doors. •\tJoinery finished in white gloss paint. •\tShelved hot press with factory insulated cylinder. •\tThermostatically controlled rooms. •\tUnderfloor heating throughout.   EXTERIOR STANDARD FEATURES  •\t10- year structural guarantee •\tAluminium fascia and soffit. •\tNap plaster finish to exterior. •\tPlastered concrete walls to front, back and sides of house. •\tGrey woodgrain effect PVC triple glazed windows. •\tComposite front door. •\tPatio/Barbecue are to rear where applicable. •\tLawns levelled and seeded. •\tHigh specification insulation throughout. •\tWater, sewerage and electrical connection fees. •\tRadon Gas protection. •\tConcrete footpaths. •\tBlue/Black roof slates. •\tOutside tap. •\tBrick paving finish to driveways with 2 car spaces. •\tExternal walls of house painted."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
